{"id":"c0536b9a92872a31","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-boolean-prime-ideal.md","title":"ZFC Boolean Prime Ideal","display":"df-zfc-boolean-prime-ideal — ZFC Boolean Prime Ideal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-boolean-prime-ideal","aliases":["58-df-zfc-boolean-prime-ideal"],"display":"df-zfc-boolean-prime-ideal — ZFC Boolean Prime Ideal","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-boolean-prime-ideal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-boolean-prime-ideal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-boolean-prime-ideal — ZFC Boolean Prime Ideal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a5e10857074b912e\" href=\"?note=a5e10857074b912e\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B\\in V\">\\(I,B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B)\">\\(\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B)\\)</span>（见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a5e10857074b912e\" href=\"?note=a5e10857074b912e\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BooleanIdeal}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{BooleanIdeal}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BooleanPrimeIdeal}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{BooleanPrimeIdeal}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span>（此处定义）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{BooleanIdeal}_S(I,B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,0_B)\\leftrightarrow I\\subseteq B\\land0_B\\in I\\land\\forall a,b\\in I\\;(a\\vee_Bb\\in I)\\land\\forall a\\in I\\;\\forall b\\in B\\;(b\\wedge_Ba=b\\to b\\in I)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{BooleanIdeal}_S(I,B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,0_B)\\leftrightarrow I\\subseteq B\\land0_B\\in I\\land\\forall a,b\\in I\\;(a\\vee_Bb\\in I)\\land\\forall a\\in I\\;\\forall b\\in B\\;(b\\wedge_Ba=b\\to b\\in I)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}prime\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{BooleanPrimeIdeal}_S(I,B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B)\\land\\mathrm{BooleanIdeal}_S(I,B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,0_B)\\land I\\neq B\\land\\forall a,b\\in B\\;(a\\wedge_Bb\\in I\\to a\\in I\\lor b\\in I)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}prime\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{BooleanPrimeIdeal}_S(I,B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B)\\land\\mathrm{BooleanIdeal}_S(I,B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,0_B)\\land I\\neq B\\land\\forall a,b\\in B\\;(a\\wedge_Bb\\in I\\to a\\in I\\lor b\\in I)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>在布尔代数中，上述素性等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall a\\in B\\;(a\\in I\\lor\\neg_Ba\\in I)\">\\(\\forall a\\in B\\;(a\\in I\\lor\\neg_Ba\\in I)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>通用的 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md\">Ideal</a> 是幂集载体上的集合理想谓词，不是布尔代数理想，故不能用于此处。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a5e10857074b912e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a5e10857074b912e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B)$（见 [[../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"通用的 [[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md|Ideal]] 是幂集载体上的集合理想谓词，不是布尔代数理想，故不能用于此处。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I,B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BooleanIdeal}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BooleanPrimeIdeal}_S\\subseteq V^7","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{BooleanIdeal}_S(I,B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,0_B)\\leftrightarrow I\\subseteq B\\land0_B\\in I\\land\\forall a,b\\in I\\;(a\\vee_Bb\\in I)\\land\\forall a\\in I\\;\\forall b\\in B\\;(b\\wedge_Ba=b\\to b\\in I)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}prime\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{BooleanPrimeIdeal}_S(I,B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B)\\land\\mathrm{BooleanIdeal}_S(I,B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,0_B)\\land I\\neq B\\land\\forall a,b\\in B\\;(a\\wedge_Bb\\in I\\to a\\in I\\lor b\\in I)","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall a\\in B\\;(a\\in I\\lor\\neg_Ba\\in I)","display":false}],"bytes":1479,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1467","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-boolean-prime-ideal.md|58-df-zfc-boolean-prime-ideal]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","a5e10857074b912e","6e4f95381faac4f9"]}